Scope of this license

This license covers the code in this repository and the original illustration,
animation and generated audio made for the project (see
docs/DATA_SOURCES.md for the provenance of every asset).

It does not cover the NASA media that the project measures. Earth Information
Center visualizations and their colourbars are NASA works, used here under
NASA's media guidelines with the credit line and source page recorded per track
in backend/data/tracks.json and shown in the interface. Nothing in this project
is endorsed by, or endorses, NASA.
